-- Grade and rank (ex18): dense value-only rank under the Unit mask, then top-5 threat by grade desc. Twin of 18-grade-and-rank.bqn.
-- rank() is value-only (dense): the tied 7s (rows 1,3) share rank 1; the ¯1 sentinel survives on non-Unit rows 2,5 (Tier-2 masked write).
-- +Targeted is a mask-or: pre-targeted row 3 (threat 10, not in the top 5) survives, so the post mask has 6 ones, not 5.
-- The .bqn's third assert ((slot⊑˜1) = slot⊑˜3) is subsumed by the pinned slot column (both rows carry 1).
--! registry ../registries/18-grade-and-rank.reg
--! expect slot = 3 1 -1 1 4 -1 0 2
--! expect targeted = 0 1 1 1 1 1 0 1

Unit , Slot = rank(Initiative)
top 5 (grade desc Threat) , +Targeted
